  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "NoiseRater introduces instance-level noise valuation for diffusion model training, while Learning to Recorrupt (L2R) proposes a self-supervised framework for noise distribution agnostic image denoising. These approaches address distinct challenges in diffusion training.",
